Subject: [PATCH] Add Amazon Bedrock (Claude) agent provider

LLM_PROVIDER=bedrock switches run_scenario.py and run_experiment.py to a Converse API agent
with the same interface as agent.py. Verified end to end: hosted Arize experiments, real Daytona
sandboxes, Claude Haiku 4.5 (guardrail off: 2 refunds, score 30; on: 1 refund, score 100).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
